nfirmed before booking."]]]],["NAV",{"aria-label":"Yacht sections","class":"sticky top-[64px] z-30 -mx-4 mb-10 border-b border-[#061625]/10 bg-[#f8f7f4]/95 backdrop-blur-sm md:top-[72px]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-1 overflow-x-auto px-4 py-2 md:justify-center"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-current":"true","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors bg-[#061625] text-white"},"Overview"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Availability"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Crew"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Dining"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Accommodation"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Gallery"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Watersports"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Amenities"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Rates"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"shrink-0 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-[#061625]/70 hover:bg-[#061625]/5 hover:text-[#061625]"},"Enquire"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"ml-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#EE9739] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#061625] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EA6F33]"},"Get My Charter Proposal"]]],["DIV",{"class":"container mx-auto px-4"},["SECTION",{"class":"mt-14"},["H2",{"id":"crew","class":"mb-2 scroll-mt-32 font-display text-3xl font-normal italic text-[#061625] md:text-4xl"},"Meet Your Crew"],["P",{"class":"mb-6 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-[#061625]/70"},"The professionals who turn a charter into a personal experience — introduced with the details they have confirmed for this yacht."],["DIV",{"class":"space-y-8"},["ARTICLE",{"class":"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#061625]/5"},["DIV",{"class":"grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,320px)_1fr]"},["DIV",{"class":"relative bg-[#061625]"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/crews/1795431152_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Captain.jpg","src":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/crews/1795431152_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Captain.jpg","alt":"Hans Jürgen Arndt, Crew member","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","class":"h-72 w-full object-cover object-top md:h-full md:min-h-[320px]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col p-6 md:p-8"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"},["H3",{"class":"font-display text-2xl font-normal italic text-[#061625] md:text-3xl"},"Hans Jürgen Arndt"],["P",{"class":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#EE9739]"},"Crew member"]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#061625]/80"},["P",{"class":"whitespace-pre-line"},"Raised along the South African coast, Hans developed a love for the ocean through fishing, surfing, diving and lifesaving. By the age of 16, he was already skippering boats, beginning a journey that has grown into 20 years of seagoing experience, including 10 years of professional service aboard private and commercial sailing and motor vessels.\nAfter studying Industrial Operations Management in Industrial Engineering, Hans began a corporate career before deciding to follow his passion for the sea. His sailing adventures have taken him from the waters of South Africa aboard on a Farr 38 to transatlantic catamaran crossings from Cape Town to the Caribbean onto regattas aboard an 80-foot Swann in the United states and Caribbean. He later spent two years captaining an expedition yacht through the South Pacific, exploring remote islands and spectacular cruising grounds while discovering new dive locations. \nA qualified dive instructor with hands-on engineering experience, Hans brings both adventure and practical expertise to life aboard Endless Horizon. He loves exploring secluded anchorages, inspiring guests to try all watersports and adventures, and sharing his enthusiasm for the ocean.\nHans also enjoys setting the scene and creating a great atmosphere on board, whether it’s a day filled with adventure or a relaxed evening at anchor. Approachable and attentive, he takes pride in the details that make each charter feel special, ensuring guests feel safe, relaxed and free to enjoy every moment of their time aboard."]],["DL",{"class":"mt-5 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-[#061625]/10 pt-4 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-0.5"},["DT",{"class":"text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[#061625]/50"},"Nationality"],["DD",{"class":"text-[#061625]"},"South African"]]],["P",{"class":"mt-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-4 text-xs text-[#061625]/50"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-[#337891]","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}]],"Crew details provided by the yacht's official listing via Central Yacht Agent."]]]],["ARTICLE",{"class":"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#061625]/5"},["DIV",{"class":"grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,320px)_1fr]"},["DIV",{"class":"relative bg-[#061625]"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/crews/1795431154_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Captain_Engineer.jpg","src":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/crews/1795431154_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Captain_Engineer.jpg","alt":"Anthony Fraser, Crew member","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","class":"h-72 w-full object-cover object-top md:h-full md:min-h-[320px]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col p-6 md:p-8"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"},["H3",{"class":"font-display text-2xl font-normal italic text-[#061625] md:text-3xl"},"Anthony Fraser"],["P",{"class":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#EE9739]"},"Crew member"]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#061625]/80"},["P",{"class":"whitespace-pre-line"},"Anthony has spent much of his life on or around the water. His love of boating, engineering and adventure led him to a career at sea, where he enjoys both running a yacht and keeping everything aboard working as it should. \nA commercially endorsed RYA Yachtmaster and experienced marine engineer, Anthony has worked on a range of vessels, from high-performance motor yachts to luxury superyachts, including Sunreef catamarans. Practical and hands-on, he is equally at home at the helm or in the engine room. With a meticulous approach to maintenance and a deep understanding of yacht systems, he takes pride in keeping the yacht well maintained, prepared and ready for the next adventure.\nOutside work, Anthony is a keen spearfisherman and former chairman of the British Spearfishing Association. Years spent diving at home in south-west England and around the world, have given him a lasting appreciation for marine life and the ocean. He loves sharing that enthusiasm with guests, whether snorkelling a reef, exploring the coastline or helping someone feel more confident in the water.\nAt 6'6\", Anthony is easy to spot on deck. His easygoing nature, quick wit and British sense of humour help guests settle into life aboard Endless Horizon. He loves creating a relaxed, welcoming atmosphere where guests can feel completely at home.\nFor Anthony, the perfect charter combines exceptional service, unforgettable experiences and just the right amount of adventure."]],["DL",{"class":"mt-5 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-[#061625]/10 pt-4 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-0.5"},["DT",{"class":"text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[#061625]/50"},"Nationality"],["DD",{"class":"text-[#061625]"},"British"]]],["P",{"class":"mt-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-4 text-xs text-[#061625]/50"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-[#337891]","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}]],"Crew details provided by the yacht's official listing via Central Yacht Agent."]]]],["ARTICLE",{"class":"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#061625]/5"},["DIV",{"class":"grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,320px)_1fr]"},["DIV",{"class":"relative bg-[#061625]"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/crews/1795431155_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Chef.jpg","src":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/crews/1795431155_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Chef.jpg","alt":"Heather Arndt, Crew member","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","class":"h-72 w-full object-cover object-top md:h-full md:min-h-[320px]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col p-6 md:p-8"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"},["H3",{"class":"font-display text-2xl font-normal italic text-[#061625] md:text-3xl"},"Heather Arndt"],["P",{"class":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#EE9739]"},"Crew member"]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#061625]/80"},["P",{"class":"whitespace-pre-line"},"With 10 years of experience in private and charter yachting, Heather brings together a passion for exceptional cuisine, global flavors and life on the ocean. Her culinary style blends classical training, creative flair and inspiration gathered from more than 27,000 nautical miles of travel.\nHer culinary journey began at a farm-to-table bakery on Martha’s Vineyard, followed by formal training at the Institute of Culinary Education in New York City and a stage at Jean-Georges’ Mark Restaurant. Her entrepreneurial spirit later inspired her to establish an artisan chocolate business from her home in Maine, supplying local businesses and corporate clients with handcrafted creations.\nDrawn to the ocean and an adventurous lifestyle, Heather found a natural home in yachting. Over the past decade, she has worked aboard a variety of private and charter vessels, continually developing her craft through international culinary courses in Palma, England, the South of France and Bangkok.\nHer cooking blends classical foundations with global influences, from beautifully executed comfort-food classics to elegant fine dining and creative culinary fusions. With a particular passion for pastry, artisan breads and handcrafted specialties, she enjoys creating memorable dining experiences inspired by the destinations she visits.\nHer travels have taken her through the Panama Canal, across the South Pacific, to New Zealand, throughout Europe and the Bahamas, and along the eastern coast of the United States. These experiences have deepened her appreciation for local cultures, regional ingredients and the flavors that make each destination unique.\nBeyond the galley, she enjoys diving as a PADI instructor, surfing, hiking, fitness and water sports. Always curious and eager to explore, she loves discovering new cultures and culinary traditions wherever her travels take her.\nFor Heather, great food is about creating connections, sharing experiences and adding something special to every journey."]],["DL",{"class":"mt-5 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-[#061625]/10 pt-4 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-0.5"},["DT",{"class":"text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[#061625]/50"},"Nationality"],["DD",{"class":"text-[#061625]"},"American"]]],["P",{"class":"mt-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-4 text-xs text-[#061625]/50"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-[#337891]","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}]],"Crew details provided by the yacht's official listing via Central Yacht Agent."]]]],["ARTICLE",{"class":"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#061625]/5"},["DIV",{"class":"grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,320px)_1fr]"},["DIV",{"class":"relative bg-[#061625]"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"","src":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/crews/1795431156_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Stewardess.jpg","alt":"Ella Hunter-Campbell, Crew member","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","class":"h-72 w-full object-cover object-top md:h-full md:min-h-[320px]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col p-6 md:p-8"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"},["H3",{"class":"font-display text-2xl font-normal italic text-[#061625] md:text-3xl"},"Ella Hunter-Campbell"],["P",{"class":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#EE9739]"},"Crew member"]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#061625]/80"},["P",{"class":"whitespace-pre-line"},"Ella’s connection to the sea began long before her professional yachting career. Living by the sea in the south west of England, and sailing with her grandfather from a young age on her family’s Swan 46, Troubadour, she developed a love of life on the water through coastal cruising, offshore passages and competitive racing. While studying at University College London, she also competed with the university sailing club, combining her studies with weekends on the racecourse.\nAfter graduating with a First Class Master’s degree in Earth Science, Ella completed her superyacht training at UKSA and gained experience aboard private motor yachts in the Mediterranean, including a newly delivered Sunreef 100. Comfortable across both deck and interior, she brings a practical approach, an eye for detail and a willingness to turn her hand to whatever the day brings.\nHer background in hospitality spans local restaurants, cocktail bars, weddings and events. From preparing a favourite drink to adding thoughtful finishing touches before guests arrive, Ella enjoys the details that help people feel welcome and looked after. Aboard Endless Horizon, she brings that same care to creating a relaxed and memorable charter experience.\nAway from work, Ella enjoys yoga, fitness, photography, art and exploring new places. Her adventurous spirit has taken her to the summit of Mount Kilimanjaro on a charity trek and to Ecuador for community and environmental projects. With a keen interest in the natural world and a longstanding commitment to volunteering, she brings curiosity, warmth and a love of adventure to life on board."]],["DL",{"class":"mt-5 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-[#061625]/10 pt-4 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-0.5"},["DT",{"class":"text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[#061625]/50"},"Nationality"],["DD",{"class":"text-[#061625]"},"British"]]],["P",{"class":"mt-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-4 text-xs text-[#061625]/50"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-[#337891]","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}]],"Crew details provided by the yacht's official listing via Central Yacht Agent."]]]],["ARTICLE",{"class":"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#061625]/5"},["DIV",{"class":"grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,320px)_1fr]"},["DIV",{"class":"relative bg-[#061625]"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"","src":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/crews/1795431156_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Deck_Stewardess.jpg","alt":"Lizé Viljoen, Crew member","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","class":"h-72 w-full object-cover object-top md:h-full md:min-h-[320px]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col p-6 md:p-8"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"},["H3",{"class":"font-display text-2xl font-normal italic text-[#061625] md:text-3xl"},"Lizé Viljoen"],["P",{"class":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#EE9739]"},"Crew member"]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#061625]/80"},["P",{"class":"whitespace-pre-line"},"Growing up spending time on the ocean and fishing with her father, Lizé developed natural sea legs and a deep connection to the water from an early age. Her passion for the underwater world led her to become a PADI Dive Instructor, blending her love for adventure with professional maritime expertise. \n \nBefore entering the superyacht industry, Lizé spent three years working in hospitality, honing her customer service skills and attention to detail. Transitioning to yachting, she spent five months aboard Ellen’s Dream as a stewardess, playing a hands-on role in setting up the new build vessel. During her time onboard, she gained invaluable deck and seamanship experience participating in a 2,500-nautical-mile ocean crossing from Poland to Gibraltar. \n \nLizé brings an adaptable, hardworking, and team-oriented approach to life at sea. Known for her flexibility and strong work ethic, she thrives both on deck and in the interior, ensuring smooth operations and an exceptional guest experience. \nAway from yachting, Lizé stays active and true to her coastal roots. She is happiest around the water, whether diving, fitness training, fishing, hiking, or simply enjoying the ocean."]],["DL",{"class":"mt-5 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-[#061625]/10 pt-4 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-0.5"},["DT",{"class":"text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-[#061625]/50"},"Nationality"],["DD",{"class":"text-[#061625]"},"South African"]]],["P",{"class":"mt-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-4 text-xs text-[#061625]/50"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-[#337891]","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}]],"Crew details provided by the yacht's official listing via Central Yacht Agent."]]]]],["P",{"class":"mt-6 text-sm text-[#061625]/70"},"Questions about the crew, provisioning or your preferences on board?"," ",["A",{"href":"#enquire","class":"font-medium text-[#061625] underline underline-offset-4"},"Enquire about this yacht"]," ","and our charter team will help. ",["SPAN",{"class":"sr-only"},"Yacht reference: ","69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e"]]],["SECTION",{"class":"mt-14"},["H2",{"id":"dining","class":"mb-2 scroll-mt-32 font-display text-3xl font-normal italic text-[#061625] md:text-4xl"},"Dining & Cuisine"],["P",{"class":"mb-6 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-[#061625]/70"},"Menus and food photography provided for this yacht — every meal prepared fresh on board by your charter chef."],["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 rounded-xl bg-[#061625] p-6 text-white md:p-8"},["DIV",{"class":"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85 [&_b]:font-semibold [&_li]:ml-4 [&_li]:list-disc [&_p]:mb-3 [&_strong]:font-semibold"},["P",{},["I",{},["STRONG",{},"A PRIVATE COLLECTION OF CUISINE"]]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["I",{},["STRONG",{},"Handcrafted by Chef Heather Arndt"]]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["I",{},["STRONG",{},"MENUS TAILORED TO LIFE ON BOARD"]]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["I",{},["STRONG",{},"Seasonal ingredients • Thoughtful preparation • Made on board"]]],["P",{}," "],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"BREAKFAST"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Freshly Baked Pastries"],["P",{},"Warm butter croissants, pain au chocolat, seasonal Danish pastries, fruit pastries and house-made muffins."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Seasonal Fruit & Berries"],["P",{},"A selection of freshly cut seasonal fruits, exotic fruits and berries, served with Greek yoghurt, local honey and toasted granola."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"House-Made Granola & Bircher Muesli"],["P",{},"Toasted oats, nuts, seeds and dried fruit; overnight oats with grated apple, seasonal berries and natural yoghurt."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Avocado Toast"],["P",{},"Sourdough toast, crushed avocado, heirloom cherry tomatoes, chilli flakes, lemon and micro herbs. Optional poached eggs."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Eggs Benedict"],["P",{},"Toasted English muffin, delicate poached eggs, Canadian bacon and classic hollandaise."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Smoked Salmon & Scrambled Eggs"],["P",{},"Soft scrambled eggs, cold-smoked salmon, crème fraîche, chives and toasted sourdough."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Shakshuka"],["P",{},"Eggs gently baked in a spiced tomato and roasted pepper sauce, finished with fresh herbs and crumbled feta."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Buttermilk Pancakes"],["P",{},"Fluffy pancakes with seasonal berries, whipped mascarpone and warm maple syrup."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"French Toast Brioche"],["P",{},"Vanilla-scented brioche, caramelised banana, cinnamon, crème anglaise and maple syrup."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Made-to-Order Breakfast"],["P",{},"Omelets, eggs any style, breakfast meats, grilled tomatoes, sautéed mushrooms and seasonal accompaniments."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"ARTISAN BREADS & BAKING"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Freshly Baked On Board"],["P",{},"A rotating selection of freshly prepared breads, baked in-house and served warm."],["P",{},"• Traditional French baguette with a crisp golden crust"],["P",{},"• Naturally leavened artisan sourdough"],["P",{},"• Rustic whole grain and seeded bread"],["P",{},"• Soft, buttery brioche"],["P",{},"• Rosemary and sea salt focaccia finished with extra virgin olive oil"],["P",{},"• Buttermilk biscuits, served warm"],["P",{},"• Soft dinner rolls and assorted specialty breads"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"House-Made Accompaniments"],["P",{},"Whipped cultured butter, roasted garlic butter, herb-infused olive oil, seasonal compound butters and flavoured dipping oils."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"LUNCH"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Soups"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Chilled Peach & Cucumber Gazpacho"],["P",{},"Ripe seasonal peaches and crisp cucumber blended with fresh herbs, citrus and champagne vinegar. Finished with basil oil, finely diced cucumber and extra virgin olive oil."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Classic Lobster Bisque"],["P",{},"Rich shellfish reduction, delicate lobster, cream and a hint of cognac, finished with fresh herbs."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Roasted Tomato & Red Pepper Soup"],["P",{},"Slow-roasted tomatoes and sweet peppers, basil oil, whipped crème fraîche and parmesan crisp."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Wild Mushroom Velouté"],["P",{},"A silky blend of seasonal mushrooms, aromatic herbs and cream, finished with truffle oil and crisp mushroom garnish."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Composed Salads"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Burrata, Basil Pesto & Heirloom Tomato Salad"],["P",{},"Creamy fresh burrata, heritage tomatoes, house-made basil pesto, toasted pine nuts, rocket, aged balsamic reduction and extra virgin olive oil."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Roasted Beetroot & Whipped Goat Cheese Salad"],["P",{},"Slow-roasted heritage beetroot, whipped chèvre, peppery rocket, candied walnuts, pickled shallots, orange-infused vinaigrette and aged balsamic gastrique."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Niçoise Salad"],["P",{},"Seared yellowfin tuna, haricots verts, baby potatoes, soft-boiled egg, Niçoise olives, cherry tomatoes and classic Dijon vinaigrette."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Grilled Peach & Prosciutto Salad"],["P",{},"Caramelised seasonal peaches, delicate prosciutto, fresh mozzarella, baby greens, toasted pistachio and white balsamic dressing."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Asian-Inspired Tuna Salad"],["P",{},"Sesame-crusted tuna, shaved vegetables, avocado, edamame, fresh herbs and ginger-soy dressing."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Classic Caesar Salad"],["P",{},"Crisp baby gem lettuce, parmesan shavings, house-made sourdough croutons and traditional Caesar dressing. Optional grilled chicken or prawns."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Sandwiches & Bowls"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Lobster Roll"],["P",{},"Fresh lobster dressed with lemon mayonnaise, celery, chives and herbs, served in a toasted brioche roll."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Steak Sandwich"],["P",{},"Sliced grilled beef, caramelised onions, rocket, aged cheddar and peppercorn aioli on toasted artisan bread."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Grilled Chicken & Avocado Wrap"],["P",{},"Herb-marinated chicken, avocado, crisp lettuce, tomato and lemon-herb dressing."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Mediterranean Grain Bowl"],["P",{},"Quinoa, roasted seasonal vegetables, hummus, cucumber, olives, feta, fresh herbs and lemon tahini dressing."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Poke Bowl"],["P",{},"Sushi-grade tuna or salmon, sushi rice, avocado, edamame, cucumber, pickled ginger, sesame and soy dressing."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"CANAPÉS"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Hot"],["P",{},"• Seared scallops, cauliflower purée and crisp pancetta"],["P",{},"• Mini beef Wellington with red wine jus"],["P",{},"• Tempura prawns with citrus ponzu"],["P",{},"• Crab cakes with saffron aioli"],["P",{},"• Truffle and wild mushroom arancini"],["P",{},"• Miniature lobster brioche rolls"],["P",{},"• Crispy duck with hoisin and cucumber"],["P",{},"• Parmesan and herb gougères"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Cold"],["P",{},"• Tuna tartare, avocado and sesame crisp"],["P",{},"• King prawn cocktail with Marie Rose sauce"],["P",{},"• Smoked salmon blinis with dill crème fraîche"],["P",{},"• Beef carpaccio crostini with parmesan and rocket"],["P",{},"• Whipped goat cheese tartlets with caramelised onion"],["P",{},"• Tomato and basil bruschetta"],["P",{},"• Watermelon, feta and mint skewers"],["P",{},"• Cucumber cups with crab and citrus"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"STARTERS"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Seared Scallops"],["P",{},"Golden-seared scallops, cauliflower silk, crispy pancetta, apple gel and brown butter."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Beef Carpaccio"],["P",{},"Paper-thin beef tenderloin, parmesan shavings, capers, rocket, truffle dressing and toasted crostini."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Tuna Tartare"],["P",{},"Hand-cut yellowfin tuna, avocado, citrus ponzu, sesame, fresh herbs and crispy wonton."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Burrata & Heirloom Tomato"],["P",{},"Creamy burrata, marinated heritage tomatoes, basil oil, aged balsamic and toasted sourdough."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"King Prawn Cocktail"],["P",{},"Chilled king prawns, crisp baby gem, avocado and a house-made cognac Marie Rose sauce."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Crab & Avocado"],["P",{},"Fresh crab meat, avocado mousse, citrus gel, cucumber ribbons and delicate herb salad."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Wild Mushroom Ravioli"],["P",{},"Handmade pasta filled with wild mushrooms and ricotta, finished with sage brown butter and aged parmesan."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"MAIN COURSES"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Beef"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Beef Tenderloin"],["P",{},"Pan-seared beef fillet, pommes Anna, seasonal vegetables, red wine jus and shallot purée."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Slow-Braised Short Rib"],["P",{},"Tender braised beef short rib, silky potato purée, glazed baby carrots and rich red wine reduction."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Beef Wellington"],["P",{},"Beef tenderloin wrapped in mushroom duxelles and golden puff pastry, served with fondant potato, seasonal greens and Madeira jus."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Grilled Ribeye"],["P",{},"Prime ribeye, truffle fries, roasted garlic butter, grilled asparagus and peppercorn sauce."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Seafood"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Pan-Seared Chilean Sea Bass"],["P",{},"Crisp-skinned sea bass, saffron beurre blanc, fennel purée, seasonal greens and citrus oil."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Butter-Poached Lobster Tail"],["P",{},"Sweet lobster tail, creamy potato purée, charred asparagus, lemon beurre blanc and fresh herbs."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Miso-Glazed Black Cod"],["P",{},"Silky black cod with a caramelised miso glaze, ginger rice, bok choy and sesame dressing."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Herb-Crusted Salmon"],["P",{},"Oven-roasted salmon, crushed new potatoes, fine green beans, dill beurre blanc and lemon oil."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Seared Tuna Loin"],["P",{},"Sesame-crusted tuna, Asian greens, coconut rice, pickled vegetables and ginger-soy reduction."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Pan-Roasted Halibut"],["P",{},"Delicate halibut, spring pea purée, baby vegetables, crispy capers and champagne sauce."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Poultry"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Roasted Chicken Supreme"],["P",{},"Pan-roasted chicken breast, fondant potato, wild mushrooms, seasonal vegetables and thyme jus."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Duck Breast"],["P",{},"Pan-seared duck breast, potato gratin, glazed baby carrots, cherry gastrique and orange reduction."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Chicken Ballotine"],["P",{},"Chicken breast filled with herbs and spinach, wrapped and roasted, served with pomme purée and natural jus."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Chicken Piccata"],["P",{},"Tender chicken breast, lemon-caper butter sauce, parmesan polenta and seasonal greens."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Pork"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Pork Tenderloin"],["P",{},"Herb-crusted pork tenderloin, apple purée, roasted root vegetables and cider jus."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Slow-Roasted Pork Belly"],["P",{},"Crisp pork belly, creamy parsnip purée, glazed apple, seasonal greens and spiced jus."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"VEGETARIAN & PLANT-BASED"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Wild Mushroom Risotto"],["P",{},"Creamy arborio rice, wild mushrooms, parmesan, truffle oil and fresh herbs."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Roasted Vegetable Wellington"],["P",{},"Seasonal roasted vegetables, spinach and mushroom duxelles encased in golden puff pastry, served with herb jus."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Cauliflower Steak"],["P",{},"Charred cauliflower, smoked aubergine purée, toasted almonds, pomegranate and tahini dressing."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Ricotta & Spinach Ravioli"],["P",{},"Handmade pasta filled with ricotta and spinach, sage brown butter, parmesan and toasted hazelnuts."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Aubergine Parmigiana"],["P",{},"Layers of roasted aubergine, slow-cooked tomato, mozzarella, basil and parmesan, baked until golden."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Coconut & Vegetable Curry"],["P",{},"Seasonal vegetables simmered in aromatic coconut curry, served with fragrant basmati rice and fresh herbs."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"DESSERTS & PÂTISSERIE"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Dark Chocolate Fondant"],["P",{},"Warm dark chocolate fondant with a molten centre, vanilla bean ice cream and fresh berries."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Lemon Tart"],["P",{},"Delicate sweet pastry, sharp lemon curd, Italian meringue and raspberry coulis."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Vanilla Bean Panna Cotta"],["P",{},"Silky vanilla panna cotta, seasonal fruit compote and crisp almond tuille."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Crème Brûlée"],["P",{},"Classic vanilla bean custard with a delicate caramelised sugar crust."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Sticky Toffee Pudding"],["P",{},"Warm date sponge, rich butterscotch sauce and vanilla ice cream."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Pavlova"],["P",{},"Crisp meringue, soft marshmallow centre, Chantilly cream and seasonal fresh fruit."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Tiramisu"],["P",{},"Espresso-soaked sponge, mascarpone cream, dark chocolate and cocoa."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Seasonal Fruit Tart"],["P",{},"Buttery pastry shell, vanilla crème pâtissière, fresh seasonal fruit and apricot glaze."],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"Signature Cheesecakes"],["P",{},"A selection of rich, creamy cheesecakes, prepared in-house."],["P",{},"• Basque Burnt Cheesecake - deeply caramelised exterior, soft creamy centre and delicate vanilla notes"],["P",{},"• Chocolate Turtle Cheesecake - rich chocolate cheesecake, caramel, toasted pecans and chocolate ganache"],["P",{},"• Strawberry Vanilla Bean Cheesecake - vanilla bean cream cheese filling, fresh strawberry compote and buttery biscuit base"],["P",{},"• Classic New York Cheesecake - dense, smooth cream cheese filling with a traditional graham cracker crust"],["P",{},"• White Chocolate & Raspberry Cheesecake - white chocolate cream cheese filling, raspberry ripple and fresh berries"],["P",{},"• Salted Caramel Cheesecake - creamy caramel filling, salted caramel glaze and crisp biscuit base"],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"HOUSE-MADE SWEET TREATS"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},"• French macarons in seasonal flavours"],["P",{},"• Handcrafted chocolates and petit fours"],["P",{},"• Chocolate truffles"],["P",{},"• Freshly baked cookies"],["P",{},"• Seasonal fruit sorbets and house-made ice creams"],["P",{},"• Miniature pastries and afternoon tea selections"],["P",{}," "],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["I",{},"A BESPOKE CULINARY EXPERIENCE"]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["I",{},"Every menu is designed around the individual preferences of guests, with an emphasis on fresh seasonal produce, quality ingredients and thoughtful presentation. From relaxed family-style dining and beach picnics to elegant multi-course tasting menus, each experience is tailored to the occasion."]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["I",{},"Special dietary requirements, allergies and individual preferences are accommodated with care. Menus can be adapted to incorporate local ingredients, regional specialties and the culinary influences of each destination."]],["P",{}," "],["P",{},["I",{},"SEASONAL • THOUGHTFUL • MADE ON BOARD"]]]],["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:grid-cols-3"},["FIGURE",{"class":"overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#061625]/5 shadow-sm"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"group relative block aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#EE9739]","aria-label":"Enlarge photo: Breads"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"","src":"https://cya.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/menus/69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e/1795432144_69f33df0b5a1600bf785869e_Select-Category.jpg","alt":"Breads","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","class":"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hove